flowchart TD
  accTitle: Support ownership and AI readiness
  accDescr: Incoming tickets can have human ownership or no human takeover. No takeover does not prove AI readiness. Customer replies require delivery checks; internal notes stay internal.
  I[Incoming conversation] --> T[Scoped ticket and team routing]
  T --> H{Human takeover?}
  H -->|Yes| P[Human handling; AI paused by ticket state]
  H -->|No| A{Assigned assistant and runtime ready?}
  A -->|No| B[AI unavailable or blocked]
  A -->|Yes| D[Prepare eligible AI reply]
  P --> N[Internal note stays internal]
  P --> R[Review customer reply]
  D --> G[Current account and delivery checks]
  R --> G
  G --> O[Recorded delivery outcome]
